04","quote":"及項梁渡淮，信杖劍從之，居戲下，無所知名。項梁敗，又屬項羽，羽以爲郎中。數以策干項羽，羽不用。漢王之入蜀，信亡楚歸漢，未得知名，爲連敖。坐法當斬，其輩十三人皆已斬，次至信，信乃仰視，適見滕公，曰：『上不欲就天下乎？何爲斬壯士！』滕公奇其言，壯其貌，釋而不斬。與語，大說之。言於上，上拜以爲治粟都尉，上未之奇也。"}],"rationale":"按開篇姓名與局部事件承接，未名者不補姓名；信羽何上限明確人名主語，不以同字全域替換。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:p004","text":"及項梁渡淮，信杖劍從之，居戲下，無所知名。項梁敗，又屬項羽，羽以爲郎中。數以策干項羽，羽不用。漢王之入蜀，信亡楚歸漢，未得知名，爲連敖。坐法當斬，其輩十三人皆已斬，次至信，信乃仰視，適見滕公，曰：『上不欲就天下乎？何爲斬壯士！』滕公奇其言，壯其貌，釋而不斬。與語，大說之。言於上，上拜以爲治粟都尉，上未之奇也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m004-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005103","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m004-0006","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"信","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005099","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m004-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005103","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m004-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005104","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m004-0030","start":30,"end":31,"surface":"羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005104","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m004-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005104","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m004-0043","start":43,"end":44,"surface":"羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005104","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m004-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005105","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m004-0053","start":53,"end":54,"surface":"信","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005099","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m004-0073","start":73,"end":78,"surface":"其輩十三人","kind":